      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Left Mouse to shoot arrows - hold to charge

    Arrows pierce enemies
    when they kill them, they stick to walls to be collected

    Right Mouse to
    dash (consumes 15 energy, deals damage, immunity window)

    Space in air to
    hover (consumes energy) on ground to jump

    Red cubes are enemies, they deal
    damage on contact

    Red capsules on walls are spikes - they deal damage

    White
    capsules are destructible

    Black Spheres are explosives

    Orange cubes
    restore energy when inside them

    TAB for player stats and run history'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
